  about_h2: "I build AI products end to end and decide by measurement.",
  about_p1: "My main work is <strong>Trader AI Assistant</strong>, an AI mentoring platform for traders that I designed, built and run on my own. It has LangGraph agents that wait for a person's approval before they change anything, Deep Mentor (an agent with tools and long-term memory), hybrid search that raised memory recall from 23% to 85%, over 260 evaluation cases and a cost ledger that reserves budget before every model call.",
  about_p2: "My second area takes agents beyond the chat window: <strong>voice, image and real devices</strong>. People talk with my agents, hear answers in a cloned voice, show them what is on the screen, and it all works with real microphones and earbuds on a Mac or an iPhone. I'm here answers questions during a conversation from a local model on the Mac. Murmur translates face-to-face conversations on the iPhone, also without a network. I'm also building I'm here Personal, an everyday companion that you talk to by voice, runs only on local models on the iPhone and the Mac and keeps its memory on your devices. And I maintain <strong>finding-ledger</strong>, an open-source Python library for tracking findings from LLM evaluations.",
